## 4. 性能注意事项

### 4.1 避免每帧创建对象

```python
# [错误]：每帧创建新列表
def draw(self, screen):
    visible_cards = [c for c in self.cards if self.camera.is_visible(c.rect)]
    
# [正确]：复用对象或使用生成器
def draw(self, screen):
    for card in self.cards:
        if self.camera.is_visible(card.rect):
            card.draw(screen)
```

### 4.2 使用可见性裁剪

```python
# 只渲染摄像机视野内的实体
for card in ctx.all_cards:
    if camera.is_visible(card.rect, margin=80):
        card.draw(screen, camera)
```

